SHORT: PS/Compugraphic liberty font

An implementation of the "Arnold Boecklin font", with weight
"ExtraBold", both in Adobe Type 1 and in Compugraphic format.
I am not familiar with the compugraphic fonts, and I hope that
the compugraphic implementation is good; I work primarily with
PS fonts (with TeX), and ArnoldBoecklin-ExtraBold is complete
with hints, composite characters and kerning.

The font has been designed with TypeSmith 2.05, and is freely
distributable.

